---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/url';

const preview = url('/city-hero/preview/');
const shots = [
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/01_wide_port.jpg'), label: '01 · Port wide' },
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/02_pad_closeup.jpg'), label: '02 · Pad / A-30' },
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/03_aerial_skyline.jpg'), label: '03 · Skyline' },
  { src: url('/city-hero/renders/04_terminal_detail.jpg'), label: '04 · Terminal' },
];
---

<Base title="Nautilus Reach · 城市样本" description="Nautilus Reach — 200–770 m 科幻港区/城市质量样本">
  <main class="city-hero">
    <header class="hero-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Kitbash3D K032 / K038 / K046 · private quality sample</p>
      <h1>Nautilus Reach</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        1200 × 1200 m 平坦城市平台，40 m 挡土墙，60 m TLOF，25 m A-30。
        原生 220–240 m 英雄塔楼 + 五座 563 m 堆叠巨构；港口近景由自建终端、
        龙门架、储罐、管线、集装箱与 K034/K039 细节构成。
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="primary" href={preview}>打开实时预览 →</a>
        <a href={url('/city-hero/manifest.json')}>manifest.json</a>
      </div>
      <dl class="stats">
        <div><dt>实时 GLB</dt><dd>3.12 M tris · 40.93 MB</dd></div>
        <div><dt>材质 / draw</dt><dd>72 materials · 78 primitives</dd></div>
        <div><dt>英雄塔</dt><dd>220.3 / 222.7 / 240.7 m native</dd></div>
        <div><dt>渲染</dt><dd>Cycles · 1920×1200 · 128 samples</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </header>

    <section class="shot-grid" aria-label="Renders">
      {shots.map((shot) => (
        <a class="shot" href={shot.src}>
          <img src={shot.src} alt={shot.label} loading="lazy" />
          <span>{shot.label}</span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </section>

    <section class="notes">
      <p>
        CityStreets 本地包实际是街道家具/街角道具，因此只作为 street pods；
        City Generator L1（3.6M tris / 62 DC / 86 MB）不做整城。巨构由原生
        K038 LargeI 模块堆叠，接缝作结构环/空中平台，未做拉伸。
      </p>
      <p>
        私有样本：Kitbash3D / Modelshop 源包不随仓库分发；公开 Web 前需单独评估授权。
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .city-hero {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 84px 24px 72px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent, #67d6ff);
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 92px);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .lede {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    color: var(--dim, #9fb0bf);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 26px 0 34px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .actions a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .primary {
    border: 1px solid rgba(103, 214, 255, 0.5);
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 34px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
  .stats div { min-width: 0; }
  .stats dt {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--dim, #9fb0bf);
  }
  .stats dd {
    margin: 5px 0 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .shot-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 0 0 34px;
  }
  .shot {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #0a1016;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
  .shot:first-child { grid-row: span 2; }
  .shot img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    transition: transform 0.6s ease;
  }
  .shot:hover img { transform: scale(1.015); }
  .shot span {
    position: absolute;
    left: 10px;
    bottom: 9px;
    padding: 4px 7px;
    background: rgba(4, 9, 14, 0.68);
    color: #e9eef2;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .notes {
    max-width: 820px;
    color: var(--dim, #9fb0bf);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .notes p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .shot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .shot:first-child { grid-row: auto; }
  }
</style>
